    "status" -> "None", "summary" -> 
    "IteratedFiniteAutomaton[rule,init,t] generates the evolution of the \
iterated finite automaton with the specified rule from initial condition init \
for t steps. IteratedFiniteAutomaton[rule,s0,init,t] starts the automaton in \
state s0. IteratedFiniteAutomaton[rule,init] gives a single step of \
evolution. IteratedFiniteAutomaton[rule,s0] is the operator form that can be \
applied to an initial condition.", "synonyms" -> {}, "tabletags" -> {}, 
